            <div xml:id="d746">

                <pb facs="0610" n="494" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg494"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/11780.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Canada to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Vera Cruz</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-30T15:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 30, 1914, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The port of Vera Cruz was formally turned over to the army forces by the navy at
                    two p.m. today.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canada</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
